tests) 24ms\n ✓ tests/unit/adapters/render/templates-root.test.ts  (4 tests) 5ms\n ❯ tests/unit/port-guard.test.ts  (1 test | 1 failed) 36ms\n   ❯ tests/unit/port-guard.test.ts > port-guard > порт 5173 свободен\n     → promise rejected \"Error: port-guard: порт 5173 занят (EADDR…\" instead of resolving\n ✓ tests/unit/adapters/cli-entry.test.ts  (2 tests) 9ms\n ✓ tests/unit/adapters/user-config.test.ts  (3 tests) 4ms\n ✓ tests/unit/domain/npx.test.ts  (4 tests) 7ms\n ✓ tests/unit/adapters/busy-retry.test.ts  (2 tests) 158ms\n ✓ tests/unit/domain/memory-event-schema.test.ts  (1 test) 16ms\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯ Failed Tests 1 ⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\n\n FAIL  tests/unit/port-guard.test.ts > port-guard > порт 5173 свободен\nAssertionError: promise rejected \"Error: port-guard: порт 5173 занят (EADDR…\" instead of resolving\n ❯ tests/unit/port-guard.test.ts:18:23\n     16|       server.listen(5173, '127.0.0.1', () => server.close(() => resolv…\n     17|     });\n     18|     await expect(guard).resolves.toBeUndefined();\n       |                       ^\n     19|   });\n     20| });\n\nCaused by: Error: port-guard: порт 5173 занят (EADDRINUSE) — освободите его и перезапустите npm run check\n ❯ Server.<anonymous> tests/unit/port-guard.test.ts:11:18\n ❯ Object.onceWrapper node:events:633:26\n ❯ Server.emit node:events:518:28\n ❯ emitErrorNT node:net:1975:8\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[1/1]⎯\n\n Test Files  1 failed | 128 passed (129)\n      Tests  1 failed | 821 passed (822)\n   Start at  18:44:37\n   Duration  34.19s (transform 3.44s, setup 1.64s, collect 35.09s, tests 55.12s, environment 39ms, prepare 42.65s)\n\nEXIT: 1\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"npm run check 2>&1; echo \"EXIT: $?\"","time":{"start":1788536641654,"end":1788536711607}},"id":"prt_06d17586e001yfHHvQQFUxt4VX","sessionID":"ses_f92e90e08ffeUax1Kbq5cBosKT","messageID":"msg_06d173ed5001aYEcy1GaO6cuQk"}}
